880 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The use of disposable paper cups is quite common for the purpose of serving hot liquids like tea\054 coffee\054 and milk in places such as college canteens\054 offices\054 railway stations\054 and street\055side tea stalls\056 Although they are very useful and economical\054 the design of these cups often leads to usability problems while handling hot liquids\056)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 881 0 R
     /Pg 878 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
