892 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Disposable paper cups are used on a large scale for hot drinks like tea and coffee\056 When these cups become too hot to handle\054 it may cause discomfort to the user\054 and there are chances of spilling the liquid or even getting a burn\056 This not only affects the user while drinking but also causes a problem in a crowded place like a canteen or an office\056 It is an issue that needs to be addressed for the betterment of the users\056\n)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 893 0 R
     /Pg 878 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

