910 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The final solution is a disposable cup made of paper\054 with an edible outer sleeve to enhance grip and insulate the hand when carrying hot drinks\056 The textured sleeve made of biscuits insulates the hand and offers a better grip compared to smooth\055edged cups made of paper\056 \015\n\015\nA small area for finger support is included to ensure a secure grasp\056 After use\054 the edible sleeve can be consumed or recycled\054 eliminating the waste associated with separate sleeves\056 \015\n\015\nThis design improves comfort\054 stability\054 and sustainability\054 while maintaining the disposability of hot beverage cups\056)
     /K [ 16 ]
     /P 911 0 R
     /Pg 878 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

